{"id":"b5a8faaa27f10f81","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Exponentiation","display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Exponentiation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Exponentiation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation — ZFC Ordinal2 Ordinal Exponentiation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,E\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\beta)\\land\\Bigl((\\alpha=0\\land\\beta=0\\land\\gamma=1)\\lor(\\alpha=0\\land\\beta\\neq0\\land\\gamma=0)\\lor\\bigl(0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\exists E\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\beta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(E)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land E(0)=1\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\beta\\;(E(\\xi+1)=E(\\xi)\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to E(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}E(\\xi))\\land\\gamma=E(\\beta))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\beta)\\land\\Bigl((\\alpha=0\\land\\beta=0\\land\\gamma=1)\\lor(\\alpha=0\\land\\beta\\neq0\\land\\gamma=0)\\lor\\bigl(0&lt;\\alpha\\land\\exists E\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\beta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(E)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land E(0)=1\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\beta\\;(E(\\xi+1)=E(\\xi)\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to E(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}E(\\xi))\\land\\gamma=E(\\beta))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinal exponentiation is defined by transfinite recursion rather than by the symbol being defined. The zero-base cases are separated so that a nonzero limit exponent does not incorrectly retain the initial value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span> in its supremum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal2\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}exponentiation}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2OrdinalExponentiation}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\beta)\\land\\Bigl((\\alpha=0\\land\\beta=0\\land\\gamma=1)\\lor(\\alpha=0\\land\\beta\\neq0\\land\\gamma=0)\\lor\\bigl(0<\\alpha\\land\\exists E\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(E,\\beta+1,\\operatorname{ran}(E))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(E)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land E(0)=1\\land\\forall\\xi<\\beta\\;(E(\\xi+1)=E(\\xi)\\cdot\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\leq\\beta\\;(\\operatorname{Lim}(\\lambda)\\to E(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi<\\lambda}E(\\xi))\\land\\gamma=E(\\beta))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2997","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal2-ordinal-exponentiation]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2","36d7463d215be751"]}